FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ManyMonsLockedInPen::
    .string "POKéMON are locked in the\n"
    .string "pens. The warehouse's\p"
    .string "forced-growth subjects are\n"
    .string "being held here.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_PenUnlockedMonsFled::
    .string "The pens are unlocked. The\n"
    .string "POKéMON have fled. The\p"
    .string "forced-growth apparatus is\n"
    .string "silent.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "This MACHOKE didn't need years\n"
    .string "of training. We gave it muscle\p"
    .string "overnight! Let's see you stand\n"
    .string "in its way!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "The muscle's there! Where's\n"
    .string "the technique?$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "It knows the same moves it\n"
    .string "knew as a MACHOP. More muscle\p"
    .string "doesn't tell it when to\n"
    .string "strike.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Why wait years for power? We\n"
    .string "can turn a little GEODUDE into\p"
    .string "a GRAVELER in one session.\n"
    .string "Watch what you're buying!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "All that weight... Still the\n"
    .string "same little tricks!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "It grew a tougher body. Nobody\n"
    .string "taught it how to use that\p"
    .string "body. That part wasn't in the\n"
    .string "sales pitch.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "An ARON's little shell becomes\n"
    .string "LAIRON armor. Faster growth,\p"
    .string "faster profit. That's how we\n"
    .string "do business!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Armor can't cover every\n"
    .string "mistake!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "It still fights like the\n"
    .string "little ARON we brought in. The\p"
    .string "armor changed. Its training\n"
    .string "didn't.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1Intro::
    .string "THOMAS ordered this program.\n"
    .string "We send him results, not\p"
    .string "excuses. Stronger bodies in\n"
    .string "less time. That's what put him\p"
    .string "on the way up. You want to\n"
    .string "challenge those results?$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1Defeat::
    .string "We accelerated their growth...\n"
    .string "Not their training.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1PostBattle::
    .string "You beat the finished stock.\n"
    .string "Look at the tests before you\p"
    .string "call this a success.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_MadeItSoYouCanComeBackThrough::
    .string "I'll open the way back. Rest\n"
    .string "if you need to. The ADMIN\p"
    .string "ahead of me runs this\n"
    .string "warehouse. He still thinks\p"
    .string "power will settle everything.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2Intro::
    .string "THOMAS gave the order. We\n"
    .string "built the operation. Our\p"
    .string "reports helped him rise\n"
    .string "through TEAM ROCKET. Don't\p"
    .string "mistake unfinished training\n"
    .string "for a failure of power. I'll\p"
    .string "show you what these results\n"
    .string "can do!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2Defeat::
    .string "The bodies grew... The skills\n"
    .string "never caught up!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin2PostBattle::
    .string "Enough. Shut down the\n"
    .string "apparatus. Open the pens. This\p"
    .string "warehouse is finished. We'll\n"
    .string "report the failure to THOMAS\p"
    .string "ourselves. We're leaving.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ReportWithGraphsAndText::
    .string "FORCED-GROWTH PROGRAM. Ordered\n"
    .string "by THOMAS. Warehouse ADMIN\p"
    .string "reports. Physical evolution:\n"
    .string "successful. Learned\p"
    .string "techniques: unchanged. Control\n"
    .string "tests: incomplete. Faster\p"
    .string "bodies. No replacement for\n"
    .string "training.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonIntro::
    .string "I almost managed to sell the\n"
    .string "SAPPHIRE for huge money…\p"
    .string "Then, you just had to come along\n"
    .string "and blow the whole deal apart!\p"
    .string "Fufu… Fufufufu…\n"
    .string "There's no forgiveness for you!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonDefeat::
    .string "Gah! Darn!\n"
    .string "Darn! Darn!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GideonPostBattle::
    .string "If I can't sell it, it's worthless!\n"
    .string "Go ahead, take it!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GetLostLeaveMeBe::
    .string "What do you want now?\n"
    .string "Go on, get lost, leave me be.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_GiovannisKidHasRedHair::
    .string "What, you again?\p"
    .string "You… You're not GIOVANNI's kid,\n"
    .string "are you?\p"
    .string "No, that can't be right!\n"
    .string "GIOVANNI's kid has red hair.\p"
    .string "You don't have any reasons for\n"
    .string "bugging me. Leave me alone!$"


FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist1Intro::
    .string "Our process turns HORSEA into\n"
    .string "SEADRA ahead of schedule.\p"
    .string "Physical power, delivered\n"
    .string "immediately! Observe the\p"
    .string "result.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist1Defeat::
    .string "The body developed. Its\n"
    .string "control did not.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist1PostBattle::
    .string "The growth is real. So are the\n"
    .string "missing skills. We cannot\p"
    .string "replace practice with another\n"
    .string "exposure.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist2Intro::
    .string "ABRA becomes KADABRA without\n"
    .string "the wait. An evolved body is\p"
    .string "proof of success. Surely you\n"
    .string "can see that!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist2Defeat::
    .string "TELEPORT... That's all it\n"
    .string "learned!$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Scientist2PostBattle::
    .string "We skipped its development.\n"
    .string "The report calls that a\p"
    .string "saving. The battle calls it\n"
    .string "something else.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_Admin1Repeat::
    .string "The way back is open. The\n"
    .string "ADMIN ahead runs this\p"
    .string "warehouse.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_ComputerClosed::
    .string "FORCED-GROWTH PROGRAM: CLOSED.\n"
    .string "The apparatus is off. The\p"
    .string "report still records THOMAS's\n"
    .string "order, accelerated growth, and\p"
    .string "failed control tests.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_MachokeTest::
    .string "Controlled test. MACHOKE,\n"
    .string "strike on my count. One...\p"
    .string "MACHOKE swings before the\n"
    .string "count. Its blow is powerful,\p"
    .string "but badly timed.\n"
    .string "Again. Wait for the count.\p"
    .string "MACHOKE hesitates, then\n"
    .string "repeats the same early swing.\p"
    .string "A stronger body. The same\n"
    .string "unfinished training.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_HorseaTest::
    .string "Next subject. HORSEA. Start\n"
    .string "the forced-growth apparatus.$"

FiveIsland_RocketWarehouse_Text_SeadraTest::
    .string "HORSEA has become SEADRA!\n"
    .string "SEADRA, face the target. Use\p"
    .string "WATER GUN.\n"
    .string "SEADRA turns away. It ignores\p"
    .string "the order and sprays the\n"
    .string "floor.\p"
    .string "The evolution worked. The\n"
    .string "control did not.$"
